格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness conversation outline plugin (对话目录)","id":"gh:1333992192","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugin-conversation-outline","slug":"XavierMarquis93/dsh-plugin-conversation-outline","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness conversation outline plugin (对话目录)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation-outline"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Adds a collapsible, per-conversation outline rail to the left of the Web chat transcript. It indexes"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" the current session's user questions and agent answers in flow order; clicking an entry scrolls the"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" transcript to that message and flashes it briefly. A keyword search box beside the title filters th"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"e index across each message's full text (case-insensitive). The rail follows its own bottom while th"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"e reader stays pinned, collapses to a slim control rail, and renders nothing while no session is cur"},{"id":"p4s6","text":"der stays pinned, collapses to a slim control rail, and renders nothing while no session is current."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"See AGENTS.md for the agent-facing deployment guide."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Model Experience"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"None, as the outline renders session data already in the browser; nothing here reaches a model reque"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"e, as the outline renders session data already in the browser; nothing here reaches a model request."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"#### KV Cache effect"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"None; this package neither assembles nor sends a provider request."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Known Limitations and Deferred Work"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- The jump scrolls by chat node key, so it addresses only the currently loaded transcript window; a "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"message outside the loaded history page is not reachable until that page is loaded.\n- Assistant entr"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ies show their first text blocks only; tool calls and reasoning are not summarized in the index."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
